        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Seed Spray"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(cold, evocation, primal)\n\nThe calathgar expels thorny, frozen seeds in a 15-foot cone, dealing 1d6 piercing and 4d6 cold damage (20 basic Reflex save). In mild cold or colder environments (Core Rulebook 518), these seeds cling to living creatures they strike, dealing 1d4 persistent cold damage. The calathgar can't use Seed Spray again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
